d Shipment JSON\n\n2. **Idempotent path (CONFIRMED → CONFIRMED):**\n   - Request: POST /shipments/S-1/confirm (when already CONFIRMED)\n   - Controller: findById → check status == CONFIRMED → return existing Shipment unchanged\n   - Response: 200 OK with Shipment JSON\n\n3. **Conflict path (CANCELLED):**\n   - Request: POST /shipments/S-1/confirm (when CANCELLED)\n   - Controller: findById → check status == CANCELLED → throw ConflictException\n   - Handler: Catches exception → 409 CONFLICT with ApiError envelope containing SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED\n\n4. **Not found path:**\n   - Request: POST /shipments/S-missing/confirm\n   - Controller: findById returns null → throw ResourceNotFoundException\n   - Handler: Catches exception → 404 NOT_FOUND with ApiError envelope containing SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\n\n**Test strategy:**\n- Test 1: Create CREATED shipment, confirm it, verify status becomes CONFIRMED\n- Test 2: Create CONFIRMED shipment, confirm again, verify 200 OK and status still CONFIRMED\n- Test 3: Manually set shipment to CANCELLED in repository, attempt confirm, verify 409 CONFLICT with error code\n- Test 4: Attempt confirm on non-existent shipment, verify 404 NOT_FOUND with error code\n\n```\n<<PHASE:IMPLEMENTATION>>\n```\n\nNow I'll implement the design. First, let me add the new ErrorCode:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1377,"cache_read_input_tokens":15800,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1377},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b800d962-008f-4911-a600-bb6306c2637f","uuid":"b5d573cb-d68d-4254-908f-fe4d796e7b28","timestamp":"2026-09-10T18:38:32.602Z","request_id":"req_011CevFAcpGP2K5g6ME3cLCL"}
